Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:40.05,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,0)\frz270\bord0.3\blur10\1a&HFF&\3c&H4186DA&\pos(775,153)}『深淵孤狼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.17,0:23:40.05,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(462,0)\frz270\bord0.3\blur10\1a&HFF&\3c&H0D47A1&\pos(775,500)}塵封秘辛』
